  <div class="lampbox">
    <img class="lamp-img lamp-wide" src="assets/lamp-tube.png" width="1440" height="64" alt="灯箱灯管：中段比两端亮 18%，表面落着一层薄灰">
    <img class="lamp-img lamp-tight" src="assets/lamp-tube-tight.png" width="1440" height="48" alt="窄档灯箱灯管：灯箱高度从 64px 降到 48px，中段仍比两端亮 18%">
    <span class="screw screw-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="screw screw-2" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="screw screw-3" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="screw screw-4" aria-hidden="true"></span>
