  <header class="sign">
    <h1>修鞋铺价目板</h1>
    <p class="sign-latin">Akua&rsquo;s Cobblery &amp; Leather</p>
    <p class="claim">修鞋 12 元，换鞋跟 25 元，周三下午只收现金，找不开就下次给。</p>
    <div class="sign-act">
      <button class="btn btn-blue" id="to-portions" type="button">看今天的分量标注</button>
      <p class="sign-note">开门时间上午八点到下午五点 · 周三下午只收现金 · 改价一律在板上涂掉重写</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="prices" id="prices" aria-labelledby="prices-h">
    <h2 id="prices-h">今天的价目（元）</h2>
    <div class="cat-row">
      <button class="cat is-on" type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-cat="shoe">修鞋与换跟</button>
      <button class="cat" type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-cat="leather">皮具与上色</button>
      <p class="cat-note" id="cat-status" role="status">板上是修鞋与换跟这一档，10 行；这一档里改过价的有 3 处，都留在板上。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rows-tilt" id="rows-tilt">
      <ul class="rows" id="rows">
        <li class="row" style="--start:4px"><span class="row-name">修鞋 · 补前掌</span><span class="row-note">单只 · 含钉</span><span class="row-price"><svg class="trace" viewBox="0 0 118 44" width="118" height="44" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#stroke-outer"/><use href="#stroke-inner"/></svg><code>12.00</code></span></li>
        <li class="row" style="--start:7px"><span class="row-name">换鞋跟</span><span class="row-note">每双 · 含税</span><span class="row-price"><svg class="trace" viewBox="0 0 118 44" width="118" height="44" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#stroke-outer"/><use href="#stroke-inner"/></svg><code>25.00</code></span></li>
        <li class="row" style="--start:12px"><span class="row-name">缝开线</span><span class="row-note">每 10cm</span><span class="row-price"><svg class="trace" viewBox="0 0 118 44" width="118" height="44" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#stroke-outer"/><use href="#stroke-inner"/></svg><code>6.00</code></span></li>
        <li class="row" style="--start:5px"><span class="row-name">上油膏</span><span class="row-note">小份 200g</span><span class="row-price"><svg class="trace" viewBox="0 0 118 44" width="118" height="44" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#stroke-outer"/><use href="#stroke-inner"/></svg><code>8.00</code></span></li>
        <li class="row" style="--start:9px"><span class="row-name">换拉链头</span><span class="row-note">含料 · 单只</span><span class="row-price"><svg class="trace" viewBox="0 0 118 44" width="118" height="44" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#stroke-outer"/><use href="#stroke-inner"/></svg><code>15.00</code></span></li>
        <li class="row" style="--start:6px"><span class="row-name">皮鞋改色</span><span class="row-note">每双 · 两遍</span><span class="row-price"><svg class="trace" viewBox="0 0 118 44" width="118" height="44" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#stroke-outer"/><use href="#stroke-inner"/></svg><code>45.00</code></span></li>
        <li class="row" style="--start:11px"><span class="row-name">高跟鞋换钉</span><span class="row-note">每双 4 颗</span><span class="row-price"><svg class="trace" viewBox="0 0 118 44" width="118" height="44" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#stroke-outer"/><use href="#stroke-inner"/></svg><code>10.00</code></span></li>
        <li class="row" style="--start:8px"><span class="row-name">靴筒收窄</span><span class="row-note">每双 · 拆线</span><span class="row-price"><svg class="trace" viewBox="0 0 118 44" width="118" height="44" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#stroke-outer"/><use href="#stroke-inner"/></svg><code>60.00</code></span></li>
        <li class="row" style="--start:10px"><span class="row-name">加鞋垫</span><span class="row-note">单只 · 裁切</span><span class="row-price"><svg class="trace" viewBox="0 0 118 44" width="118" height="44" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#stroke-outer"/><use href="#stroke-inner"/></svg><code>9.00</code></span></li>
        <li class="row" style="--start:4px"><span class="row-name">急件加价</span><span class="row-note">2 小时内取</span><span class="row-price"><svg class="trace" viewBox="0 0 118 44" width="118" height="44" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#stroke-outer"/><use href="#stroke-inner"/></svg><code>30.00</code></span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p class="state err" role="alert"><span class="state-tag">这一行读错了</span>这行价格昨天改过三次，第 3 次的黑漆盖住原数字，读出来是 <code>25</code> 元而不是 <code>2.5</code> 元，错误码 <code>PAINT-3</code>。请按分量标注再核一遍。</p>

    <div class="repaint">
      <span class="blot blot-3" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="blot blot-2" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="blot blot-1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="repaint-ghost" aria-hidden="true"><code>2.5</code></span>
      <p class="repaint-note">左下角这处被盖掉的数字，原来写的是 <code>2.5</code>：三层黑漆，最新的那层比旧层小 1 毫米，一共盖过三次调价。漆没盖严的地方还看得见旧笔画的起笔。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="portions" id="portions" aria-labelledby="portions-h">
    <h2 id="portions-h">分量标注怎么读</h2>
    <p class="portions-lead">价目行右侧那一列是计价口径，不是折扣。一眼看不清的时候，按这四条对：</p>
    <ul class="notes">
      <li><b>单只／每双</b>　补前掌、换拉链头按单只算；换鞋跟、改色、收窄靴筒按双算，两只都做。</li>
      <li><b>含钉／含料</b>　钉子、拉链头、鞋蜡都算在价里，不用另付材料钱；自带的料少收 2 元。</li>
      <li><b>每 10cm／每 20cm</b>　缝开线按长度量，量到哪收到哪，不足一段按一段算。</li>
      <li><b>小份 200g</b>　上油膏按罐算，一罐 200g，够一双皮靴上两遍；剩下的罐子留在店里，下次接着用。</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>板上这四样工具，价都按它算</h3>
    <ul class="tools">
      <li>
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 64 64" role="img" aria-label="手绘鞋跟符号"><path d="M12 52 L18.4 20.6 L34 17.2 L44.3 24.1 L48 52"/><path d="M14.2 44 L46 41.2"/><path d="M30 33 L31.3 46"/></svg>
        <b>鞋跟</b><span>换跟先拆旧钉，钉子重新打 4 颗，跟面磨平才上漆。</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 64 64" role="img" aria-label="手绘钉子符号"><path d="M20 44 L44 18"/><path d="M42 14 L50 22"/><path d="M22 46 L18 50"/><path d="M46.5 8.5 L54 16"/></svg>
        <b>钉子</b><span>方头钉，长 12 毫米；钉完敲平，不许露头。</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 64 64" role="img" aria-label="手绘刷子符号"><path d="M14 22 L38 12 L44 24 L20 34 Z"/><path d="M20 34 L16 50 L40 42 L44 24"/><path d="M24 44 L36 40"/></svg>
        <b>刷子</b><span>上色用两把：一把吃色，一把收边；每把用满 40 分钟才换。</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 64 64" role="img" aria-label="手绘秤符号"><path d="M10 46 L54 46"/><path d="M32 46 L32 14"/><path d="M18 22 L46 22"/><path d="M18 22 L14 34 M18 22 L22 34 M14 34 L22 34"/><path d="M46 22 L42 34 M46 22 L50 34 M42 34 L50 34"/></svg>
        <b>秤</b><span>补皮面按处算，一处 2cm 以内；超过就上秤按重量报。</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="shut" aria-labelledby="shut-h">
